# S2 states a general principle, and P3 applies it to the earth. "In the centre" and "equipoise" keep the same physical sense: balanced position amid an evenly spread surrounding.
# A1 joins "does not incline" (stays put) to "needs no supporting force". These are two different claims, each in its own sense, so A1 is not a bridge.
